    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26山东）某公园计划建设一个梯形ABCD，来用于展示花卉，AD//BC，对角线AC和BD相交于中间观景台点O，已知AD边长4米，BC边长8米，△AOD的面积是5平方米，求问梯形ABCD的面积是多少？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "55"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "65"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "45"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "75"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          153
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          147
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01-p153.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第147页",
            "pdfPage": 153
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看平行边AD：BC=4：8=1：2。对角线相交形成的△AOD与△COB相似，线性比1：2，所以O到两条底边的高也为1：2。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "△AOD面积5、底AD=4，得到O到AD的高为2.5米，O到BC的高就是5米，整个梯形高7.5米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "h_1=\\frac{2\\times5}{4}=2.5,\\quad h=3h_1=7.5,\\quad S=\\frac{4+8}{2}\\times7.5=45"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "梯形面积（4+8）×7.5÷2=45平方米，我们选C。底边翻倍，高也翻倍时，对应小三角形面积不是只翻倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          153
