    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "梯形对角线交点两侧相似，高之比等于平行底边之比。"
        }
