    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-practice-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-practice-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先把B、C面积设为14份、9份，它们和为23份，比A大2/21，说明23份是A的23/21，因此A=21份。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "按图中标准十字矩形分割，对角矩形面积乘积相等：A×D=B×C，所以D=14×9÷21=6份。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "A=\\frac{14+9}{1+2/21}=21,\\quad D=\\frac{14\\times9}{21}=6,\\quad\\frac DA=\\frac27"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所求D：A=6：21=2：7，我们选C。大2/21是以A为基数，不能把A写成23减2份。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
