    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-practice-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "思维精练 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t01-practice-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26江苏）如图所示，在梯形ABCD中，AB//CD，点E在边BC上，CE=2BE，AE与BD相交于点F。已知△ADF与△BEF的面积分别为28和4，则△DFC的面积为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "40"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "42"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "50"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "56"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B",
        "stemBlocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "（26江苏）如图所示，在梯形ABCD中，AB//CD，点E在边BC上，CE=2BE，AE与BD相交于点F。已知△ADF与△BEF的面积分别为28和4，则△DFC的面积为："
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t01-practice-03-figure-01.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二）原题示意图，讲义第149页",
